# StoreHub CSV exports. Real business data - supplier names, unit costs, staff
# names - and ~10 MB per drop. Git history is permanent, so these stay out of it.
# The importer reads them from disk; nothing in the repo depends on them being
# committed. Fixtures for the parser tests are inline in tests/, not files.
storehub exports/
new storehub exports/
*.csv
!tests/**/*.csv
